{"4537100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "diffiCULT", "steam_appid": 4537100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>diffiCULT</strong> is a multiplayer social deduction FPS where trust breaks quickly and suspicion spreads even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each match, every player receives a hidden role. You might be part of the <strong>Town</strong> trying to uncover the cult, a <strong>Cultist</strong> secretly working against everyone, or a <strong>Solo role</strong> with its own unpredictable objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody knows who to trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lie, investigate, accuse, and survive long enough to reach your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537100/extras/3523af4bde2eb30790ef9f21ea4526bc.avif?t=1786459880\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537100/extras_big/3523af4bde2eb30790ef9f21ea4526bc.webp?t=1786459880 width=1560 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sun rises, players gather to talk about what happened during the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who acted suspiciously?<br>Who might be lying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can accuse each other and start a vote. If the town agrees, the suspected player is executed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful. One wrong vote can eliminate an innocent player and bring the cult closer to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537100/extras/27c2740b92b32dd8bb801f9e0c911536.avif?t=1786459880\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537100/extras_big/27c2740b92b32dd8bb801f9e0c911536.webp?t=1786459880 width=1560 height=312 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, every role secretly performs its ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some players investigate houses to gather information. Others protect their allies. Cultists quietly hunt their targets while solo roles move toward their own hidden goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The events of the night often change everything the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎭 Unique Roles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player receives a different role with its own abilities and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some roles collect information.<br>Some protect others.<br>Some manipulate players or create chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of this, every match unfolds differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537100/extras/9be69afb386f4138c77bdaa2e12ce95c.poster.avif?t=1786459880\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537100/extras/9be69afb386f4138c77bdaa2e12ce95c.webm?t=1786459880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537100/extras/9be69afb386f4138c77bdaa2e12ce95c.mp4?t=1786459880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Three Competing Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Town</strong><br>Work together to uncover and eliminate the cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultists</strong><br>Hide among the town and eliminate or convert players until you take control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Roles</strong><br>Play your own game. Outsmart everyone and complete your unique win condition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537100/extras/650baf708ffee58c788a53eed35578ed.avif?t=1786459880\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537100/extras_big/650baf708ffee58c788a53eed35578ed.webp?t=1786459880 width=1560 height=312 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer <strong>social deduction FPS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three competing factions</strong> with different victory conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of unique roles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime discussions and voting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night abilities that change the game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully <strong>3D first-person gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat</strong> and social interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark <strong>medieval cult atmosphere</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>diffiCULT</strong> is a multiplayer social deduction FPS where trust breaks quickly and suspicion spreads even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each match, every player receives a hidden role. You might be part of the <strong>Town</strong> trying to uncover the cult, a <strong>Cultist</strong> secretly working against everyone, or a <strong>Solo role</strong> with its own unpredictable objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody knows who to trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lie, investigate, accuse, and survive long enough to reach your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537